  "releaseNotes": "v3.2.0: Fetch history and mobile/desktop compare. Every completed fetch is recorded in a new history list (re-run past fetches with one click, clear anytime, capped at 200 rows, HTML bodies are never stored); the new Compare Mobile/Desktop button fetches the URL as both the smartphone and desktop Googlebot and highlights every differing field (title, meta, word count, noindex, cloaking, SEO and AI-readiness scores). No breaking API changes. v2.0.0: Refactored as a dedicated URL Viewer tool. Site-wide crawler and per-node SEO Audit tab moved to the companion uTPro.Feature.SEOAudit package. Engine extracted to T4VN.Seo.Core (shared by both packages). Adds Lighthouse-style composite SEO score (0â€“100) with per-category sub-scores (SEO / Technical / Content / Accessibility) and individual check pass/fail with remediation advice. Section renamed to match new dedicated role; configuration key changed to uTPro:Feature:UrlViewer.",
